# Third parties' screenshots, the bar the reviewers compare against: fetched again from the sources
# references/README.md lists, not redistributed.
references/*.png
# Each round's capture and its blind sets: made again from the commit, never carried.
rounds/*/shots/
rounds/*/council-*/
!rounds/*/council-key-*.json
# Each reviewer's raw answer and log: run metadata (session ids, usage); ledger.jsonl holds what
# they said, un-blinded.
rounds/*/review-*
# The capture's log: the report.json beside the shots says the same.
rounds/*/capture.log
